---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
import samPortrait from "../../assets/sam_riddle.jpg";
---

<section id="about" class="px-4 py-20 md:px-8">
  <Container>
    <h2 class="mb-12 text-3xl font-bold">
      About <span class="text-brand">Me</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="order-1">
        <figure class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm md:max-w-md">
          <div
            class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20"
          >
            <Image
              src={samPortrait}
              alt="Sam Riddle"
              width={896}
              height={1120}
              widths={[320, 384, 448, 640, 768, 896]}
              sizes="(min-width: 768px) 448px, (min-width: 416px) 384px, calc(100vw - 2rem)"
              format="webp"
              quality={82}
              fit="cover"
              position="top"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="aspect-[4/5] h-full w-full object-cover"
              style="object-position: 68% top;"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption
            class="border-brand mt-4 border-l-2 pl-4 md:absolute md:top-full md:right-0 md:left-0"
          >
            <p class="font-medium">Sam Riddle</p>
            <p class="text-secondary text-sm">
              The University of Alabama, 2024
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="order-2">
        <p class="text-secondary mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Hi! I'm currently a software engineer at SmarTrak.ai, where I build features 
            for the core product, support customer retention efforts, and define
            devops processes. 
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-secondary mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            I studied business operations & technology at The 
            University of Alabama. My time there not only helped me gain an appreciation 
            for football, but also led to me falling in love with the state 
            of Alabama, where I'm currently located.
        </p>

        <p class="text-secondary mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            I'm heavily value oriented. I'm highly motivated to succeed, but it’s more 
            important to me to be diligent, authentic, and reliable.
            The world needs men of character now more than ever. 
        </p>

        <p class="text-secondary mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Thanks for stopping by. Feel free to reach out if I can be of assistance!
            God Bless, and Roll Tide. 
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
